  "body": "<div class=\"white hotels-row\" id=\"hotels\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Recommended Hotels</h2>\n<p>\n<i class=\"fa fa-hotel fa-4x\"></i>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Crowne Plaza Berlin City Centre</h3>\n<p>\nNürnberger Str. 65, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p class=\"summit-location-message\">\nDiscounted Group Rate\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-389\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.ihg.com/crowneplaza/hotels/us/en/berlin/bercc/hoteldetail?qAdlt=1&amp;qBrs=6c.hi.ex.rs.ic.cp.in.sb.cw.cv.ul.vn.ki.va.sp.nd.ct&amp;qChld=0&amp;qFRA=1&amp;qGRM=0&amp;qGrpCd=FH1&amp;qIta=99801505&amp;qPSt=0&amp;qRRSrt=rt&amp;qRef=df&amp;qRms=1&amp;qRpn=1&amp;qRpp=20&amp;qSHp=1&amp;qSmP=3&amp;qSrt=sBR&amp;qWch=0&amp;srb_u=1&amp;icdv=99801505&amp;setPMCookies=true\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Park Inn by Radisson Hotel</h3>\n<p>\nAlexanderpl. 7, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-378\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.parkinn-berlin.de/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>\nBook a Room</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>H4 Hotel Berlin Alexanderplatz</h3>\n<p>\nKarl-Liebknecht-Str. 32, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-379\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.h-hotels.com/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Hotel NH Collection Berlin Friedrichstrasse</h3>\n<p>\nFriedrichstraße 96, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-380\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.nh-hotels.de/hotel/nh-collection-\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>The Westin Grand Berlin</h3>\n<p>\nFriedrichstraße 158/164, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-381\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.westingrandberlin.com/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Hilton Berlin</h3>\n<p>\nMohrenstraße 30, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-382\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.hilton.de/berlin\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Berlin Marriott Hotel</h3>\n<p>\nInge-Beisheim-Platz 1, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-383\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.berlinmarriott.de/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Sheraton Berlin Grand Hotel Esplanade</h3>\n<p>\nLützowufer 15, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-384\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.esplanade.de/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Waldorf Astoria Berlin</h3>\n<p>\nHardenbergstraße 28, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-385\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.waldorfastoriaberlin.com/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Sofitel Berlin Kurfüstendamm</h3>\n<p>\nAugsburger Str. 41, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-386\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.xn--sofitel-berlin-kurfrstendamm-k7c.com/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Swissôtel Berlin</h3>\n<p>\nAugsburger Str. 44, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-387\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.swissotel.com/berlin\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>Steigenberger Hotel Berlin</h3>\n<p>\nLos-Angeles-Platz 1, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-388\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.steigenberger.com/berlin\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\">\n<h3>InterContinental Berlin</h3>\n<p>\nBudapester Str. 2, Berlin, DE\n</p>\n<p>\n<a class=\"marker-link\" href=\"#location-390\"><i class=\"fa fa-map-marker\"></i>Map</a>\n<a href=\"http://www.berlin.intercontinental.com/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"></i>Website</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"light\" id=\"travel-support\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-lg-push-2\">\n<h2>Travel Support Program</h2>\n<p>The OpenStack Travel Support Program's aim is to facilitate participation of key contributors to the OpenStack Summit by covering the costs for their travel and accommodation. The OpenStack Foundation will set aside a fund to support this program. If you are a key contributor to OpenStack and your company does not cover the costs of your travel and accommodation to Berlin, you can <a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/travelsupportberlin\" target=\"_blank\">apply for the Travel Support Program</a>. The total amount of the fund is to be divided among the approved key contributors.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.openstack.org/wiki/Travel_Support_Program\">View more information about the selection process</a><span>.</span></p>\n<p>For the Vancouver Summit, individuals contributed $8,398 to the Travel Support Program. Combined with funds from the OpenStack Foundation, 38 attendees were sponsored to attend the Summit. If you would like to contribute to the Berlin Summit Travel Support Program, <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/openstack-summit-november-2018-berlin-tickets-41880169715\">donate here</a>. </p>\n<h3>Additional Information</h3>\n<ul><li>The deadline to <a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/travelsupportberlin\" target=\"_blank\">apply for Travel Support</a>is <strong>August 30, 2018</strong></li>\n<li>All contributors to OpenStack (developers, documentation writers, organizers of user groups around the world, Ask moderators, speakers, translators, etc) are invited to submit a request. You can apply by filling out <a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/travelsupportberlin\">this form</a>.</li>\n<li>Approved grantees will be notified the week of <strong>September 11, 2018</strong>.</li>\n</ul><p>If you have questions about the Travel Support Program, please email <a href=\"mailto:summit@openstack.org\">summit@openstack.org</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"white visa-row\" id=\"visa\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-8 col-lg-push-2\">\n<h2>How to apply for a Visa</h2>\n<p>To find out what type of visa you require to travel to Germany, and if you require a visa invitation letter, please <a href=\"http://www.germany-visa.org/do-i-need-a-visa/\" target=\"_blank\">visit this webpage</a><em>before</em>filling out the form. </p>\n<p>As a general planning guideline, if a visa is needed, a foreign traveler should apply for his or her visa as soon as possible, preferably no later than 60 days before the travel date.</p>\n<h3>Visa Invitation Letter request</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/visa_form_berlin_summit\" target=\"_blank\">Requests for invitation letters</a>must be received before <strong>October 30, 2018</strong>. </p>\n<p>We will send your visa invitation letter to the email you provide on <a href=\"https://openstackfoundation.formstack.com/forms/visa_form_berlin_summit\" target=\"_blank\">this form</a>. No hard copies will be sent. Visa letters will be issued within a 5 business day turnaround timeframe, beginning June 18. Please do not follow up before then. If you have questions please email <a href=\"mailto:eventvisa@openstack.org\">eventvisa@openstack.org</a>.</p>\n<hr />\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"venue\">\n<div class=\"venue-row tokyo\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/summit-travel-archive/summits/locations/CityCubeBerlin-sm.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2>The Venue</h2>\n<p>\n<strong>CityCube Berlin</strong>\nMessedamm 26<br />\nBerlin ,  14055\n</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"photo-credit\" href=\"https://flic.kr/p/8rYHEd\" target=\"_blank\">\n<i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"white city-intro\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<blockquote>There are few cities in the world that transform themselves as profoundly from season to season as Berlin.</blockquote>\n<div class=\"testimonial-attribute\"><img alt=\"New York Times on Vancouver\" src=\"/assets/summit-travel-archive/summit/images/nytimes.png\" /><p>New York Times on Berlin</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
